# roccolr
**MSc in Computer Engineering · Embedded Systems**  
Napoli, Italy · [LinkedIn](https://linkedin.com/in/roccolorusso)

I design and optimize low-level software and hardware-software interfaces, focusing on execution efficiency, deterministic behavior, and resource-constrained architectures.

### Current Focus
* **Real-Time Systems:** RTOS kernel primitives, scheduling, and concurrency.
* **Hardware & RTL:** Digital electronics design and FPGA synthesis.
* **Parallel Computing:** High-performance C/CUDA programming and hardware acceleration.
* **Machine Learning:** Classical supervised/unsupervised models and edge inference.

